  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 303.07 National Guard Exemption. The license requirements of this chapter shall not apply to any member of the New Hampshire National Guard while in a unit training assembly status and enrolled in a plumbing program as part of their military training. Such training shall only be provided under the direct supervision of an instructor who holds a current master plumber's license under this chapter.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15",
